      "updated": 1790338003291,
      "created": 1790338002901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BookishEngine creates and owns every service. Importing, Exporting, RecordActions, Recognition and Browser\nalso report through Status; those arrows are omitted for clarity.\nThe orange edge is the temporary coarse refresh revision, pending fine-grained record observation.",
